  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">這是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torohealth-damage-indicators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ToroHealth 傷害指示器</a> 的非官方移植版，相容於 Forge 1.20。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">使用 <strong>ToroHealth</strong> 傷害指示器，玩家十字準心瞄準的實體會在左上角顯示生命值條。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/303/407/hud.png\" alt=\"HUD\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">其他詳細資訊，請查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torohealth-damage-indicators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始模組頁面</a>。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">如果原始模組也已更新至該版本，建議您<strong>優先使用原始模組</strong>。</span></p>",
